# The repository's blobs are LF, but Windows machines with core.autocrlf=true would
# check them out as CRLF. Several suites read app.js, views.css and components.css as
# SOURCE TEXT and match patterns containing "\n", so a fresh clone on Windows would
# fail suites that pass on the machine that wrote them. This makes the checkout agree
# with the blobs, and with the suites, everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
